{
  "name": "Chatbot Grup WA",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionId": "<__PLACEHOLDER_VALUE__Pilih session OpenWA (nomor bot)__>",
        "filters": "{\"conditions\":[{\"field\":\"isGroup\",\"operator\":\"is\",\"value\":true},{\"field\":\"fromMe\",\"operator\":\"is\",\"value\":false},{\"field\":\"type\",\"operator\":\"is\",\"value\":[\"text\"]}]}",
        "deduplicateDeliveries": true
      },
      "id": "6e4f927c-d3f0-4b84-8529-c5aa2e22386f",
      "name": "Pesan Grup WA Masuk",
      "type": "@rmyndharis/n8n-nodes-openwa.openWaTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "chat-id",
              "name": "chatId",
              "value": "={{ $json.data?.chatId ?? $json.data?.from ?? $json.chatId ?? $json.from ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "message-id",
              "name": "messageId",
              "value": "={{ $json.data?.id?._serialized ?? $json.data?.id ?? $json.id?._serialized ?? $json.id ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sender",
              "name": "sender",
              "value": "={{ $json.data?.author ?? $json.data?.sender ?? $json.author ?? $json.data?.from ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "body",
              "name": "body",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data?.body ?? $json.body ?? \"\").trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "question",
              "name": "question",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data?.body ?? $json.body ?? \"\").trim().replace(/^\\/tanya\\s*/i, \"\") }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dc0ec730-ba2d-4533-a33b-4aedb97cc8da",
      "name": "Normalisasi Pesan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        272,
        336
      ],
      "notes": "Struktur payload OpenWA bisa berbeda antar versi/engine. Cocokkan field di sini dengan hasil eksekusi nyata pertama."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "prefix",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "startsWith"
              },
              "rightValue": "/tanya"
            },
            {
              "id": "has-question",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.question }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {
          "ignoreCase": true
        }
      },
      "id": "64384c5e-8614-48d6-9e19-bdeebb910744",
      "name": "Hanya Pesan /tanya",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        496,
        336
      ],
      "notes": "Gerbang pemicu: bot hanya merespons pesan berawalan /tanya agar tidak menyela obrolan grup dan tidak memicu dirinya sendiri."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Pengirim: {{ $json.sender }}\nWaktu: {{ $now.setZone(\"Asia/Jakarta\").toFormat(\"yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm\") }} WIB\nPertanyaan: {{ $json.question }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Anda adalah asisten Seksi Monitoring dan Evaluasi (Monev) di grup WhatsApp PIC fakultas dan unit.\n\nTugas: menjawab pertanyaan tentang kinerja, validasi data, jadwal, dan tata cara sanggah HANYA berdasarkan Juknis/SOP.\n\nAturan:\n1. Selalu panggil alat cari_juknis_monev terlebih dahulu. Jangan menjawab dari pengetahuan umum.\n2. Jika hasil pencarian memuat jawabannya: jawab singkat (maksimal 5 kalimat), bahasa Indonesia formal, lalu tulis baris terakhir \"Rujukan: <nama dokumen/bagian>\".\n3. Jika hasil pencarian tidak memuat jawabannya: balas persis \"Maaf, hal ini belum diatur di juknis. Pertanyaan Anda diteruskan ke admin Monev.\" Jangan menebak.\n4. Jangan memberi keputusan atas sanggah; jelaskan prosedurnya saja.\n5. Format teks polos WhatsApp, tanpa markdown heading atau tabel.",
          "enableStreaming": false,
          "forceToolCallOnFirstIteration": true
        }
      },
      "id": "3f0e7dc4-bfdc-4fc4-b22a-9ac2c9bbd4f4",
      "name": "Agen Juknis Monev",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        816,
        208
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "d34499fc-d847-4971-b375-d1324a67a599",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        752,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Normalisasi Pesan').item.json.chatId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 6
      },
      "id": "437f83f8-1675-4be3-aaf3-0cd9ee0a394f",
      "name": "Memori per Grup",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        880,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Mencari potongan teks dari Juknis dan SOP Monitoring dan Evaluasi kinerja (validasi data kinerja, jadwal, tata cara sanggah, evaluasi bulanan). Panggil alat ini untuk SETIAP pertanyaan sebelum menjawab. Masukkan kata kunci atau pertanyaan dalam Bahasa Indonesia. Hasil berisi teks dan metadata nama dokumen/bagian.",
        "memoryKey": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "juknis_monev"
        },
        "topK": 5
      },
      "id": "7c8bcc51-d8ae-4626-9ad0-3c53711610b7",
      "name": "cari_juknis_monev",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1008,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f54ad2f4-cfde-41a7-9324-6b4b466d20a5",
      "name": "Gemini Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1008,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "reply",
        "sessionId": "<__PLACEHOLDER_VALUE__Pilih session OpenWA (nomor bot)__>",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Normalisasi Pesan').item.json.chatId }}",
        "idempotencyKey": "=reply-{{ $execution.id }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "quotedMessageId": "={{ $('Normalisasi Pesan').item.json.messageId }}"
      },
      "id": "72b3f748-bf6f-4ff9-9c50-9c760a772c65",
      "name": "Balas di Grup WA",
      "type": "@rmyndharis/n8n-nodes-openwa.openWa",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1216,
        208
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Sebelum diaktifkan\n1. Buat credential **OpenWA API**, **Google Gemini (PaLM) API**, lalu pilih di node yang bertanda merah.\n2. Pilih **session** (nomor bot khusus) di node trigger dan node balas.\n3. Jalankan workflow ingest juknis (`ingest-juknis.json`) untuk mengisi vector store `juknis_monev`.\n4. Uji kirim `/tanya ...` di grup, lalu cocokkan field di node Normalisasi Pesan.\n\n**Catatan:** vector store in-memory hilang saat n8n restart.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1c13eee8-b352-4d6a-90d5-48c895222966",
      "name": "Petunjuk Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
